     <span class=\"badge badge-outline\">service design</span>\n            </div>\n          </div>\n          <p class=\"muted small\">Zdravje Clinics · Product designer</p>\n          <p>Self-serve booking that halved front-desk calls.</p>\n          <div class=\"grid cols-2 gap-lg\" style=\"margin-top:0.5rem;\">\n            <div class=\"stack gap-sm\">\n              <div class=\"stat-value\" style=\"color:#166534;\">58%</div>\n              <div class=\"stat-label\">fewer booking calls</div>\n            </div>\n            <div class=\"stack gap-sm\">\n              <div class=\"stat-value\" style=\"color:#166534;\">91%</div>\n              <div class=\"stat-label\">patients book online</div>\n            </div>\n          </div>\n        </div>\n\n        <div class=\"card project-card stack gap-sm\" data-tags=\"data viz\" style=\"padding:1.75rem;\">\n          <div class=\"row between center\" style=\"flex-wrap:wrap;gap:0.5rem;\">\n            <div class=\"row center gap-sm\">\n              <h4 style=\"margin:0;\">Open data dashboard</h4>\n              <span class=\"badge badge-secondary\">2024</span>\n            </div>\n            <div class=\"row gap-sm\" style=\"flex-wrap:wrap;\">\n              <span class=\"badge badge-outline\">data viz</span>\n            </div>\n          </div>\n          <p class=\"muted small\">City of Ljubljana · Design and front-end</p>\n          <p>City budget explorer used by 30k residents.</p>\n          <div class=\"alert\" style=\"margin-top:0.5rem;\">\n            <span class=\"small\">📰 Featured by two national newspapers; codebase open-sourced.</span>\n          </div>\n        </div>\n\n      </div>\n    </div>\n\n    <div class=\"hr\"></div>\n\n    <!-- Impact Chart -->\n    <div class=\"stack gap-sm\">\n      <h3>Outcome over time</h3>\n      <p class=\"muted small\">App store rating across redesign period</p>\n      <div data-chart='{\"type\":\"line\",\"title\":\"App Store Rating (Transit Redesign)\",\"data\":[{\"label\":\"Jul\",\"value\":3.4},{\"label\":\"Aug\",\"value\":3.6},{\"label\":\"Sep\",\"value\":3.8},{\"label\":\"Oct\",\"value\":4.1},{\"label\":\"Nov\",\"value\":4.3},{\"label\":\"Dec\",\"value\":4.6}]}'></div>\n    </div>\n\n    <div class=\"hr\"></div>\n\n    <!-- Testimonial -->\n    <div class=\"card testimonial-card stack gap-sm\" style=\"padding:2rem;\">\n      <p class=\"lead\" style=\"font-style:italic;line-height:1.6;\">\"Mira turned a tangle of requirements into something our riders actually enjoy using.\"</p>\n      <div class=\"row center gap-sm\" style=\"margin-top:0.75rem;\">\n        <div class=\"avatar\" style=\"width:36px;height:36px;border-radius:50%;background:var(--color-border,#e5e7eb);display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:center;font-size:0.75rem;font-weight:700;\">TZ</div>\n        <div class=\"stack\">\n          <strong style=\"font-size:0.9rem;\">Tina Zupan</strong>\n          <span class=\"muted small\">Head of Digital, LPP</span>\n        </div>\n      </div>\n    </div>\n\n    <!-- Contact -->\n    <div class=\"card center stack gap-lg\" style=\"padding:3rem;margin-top:1rem;\">\n      <div class=\"stack gap-sm center\">\n        <h2>Let's work together</h2>\n        <p class=\"muted\" style=\"max-width:400px;\">Available for freelance product design engagements starting January.</p>\n      </div>\n      <div class=\"row gap-sm\">\n        <a href=\"mailto:mira@example.com\" class=\"btn btn-lg\">mira@example.com</a>\n      </div>\n      <p class=\"small muted\">Typically replies within 24 hours</p>\n    </div>\n\n    <!-- Footer -->\n    <div class=\"row between center\" style=\"padding:1rem 0;border-top:1px solid var(--color-border,#e5e7eb);\">\n      <span class=\"small muted\">© 2026 Mira Kovač</span>\n      <span class=\"small muted\">Ljubljana, Slovenia</span>\n    </div>\n\n  </div>\n</div>\n\n<script>\n  const filterBtns = document.querySelectorAll('.filter-btn');\n  const projectCards = document.querySelectorAll('.project-card');\n\n  filterBtns.forEach(btn => {\n    btn.addEventListener('click', () => {\n      filterBtns.forEach(b => b.classList.remove('filter-active'));\n      btn.classList.add('filter-active');\n\n      const filter = btn.dataset.filter;\n\n      projectCards.forEach(card => {\n        if (filter === 'all') {\n          card.style.display = '';\n          return;\n        }\n        const tags = card.dataset.tags.split(' ');\n        card.style.display = tags.includes(filter) ? '' : 'none';\n      });\n    });\n  });\n</script>\n```","deltas":[[6594,"```html\n<style"],[6604,">\n  ."],[6771,"hero-avatar {\n"],[6781,"    width"],[6781,": 72"],[6781,"px"],[6781,";\n    height"],[6781,": 72"],[6798,"px;\n   "],[6862," border-radius: "],[6893,"5"],[6893,"0%;\n   "],[6954," background: var(--"],[6958,"color"],[7017,"-accent, #"],[7017,"6"],[7017,"366f"],[7017,"1);\n"],[7071,"    color: #"],[7071,"fff;\n   "],[7123," display: flex;"],[7169,"\n    align-items"],[7176,": center"],[7177,";\n    justify"],[7209,"-content: center;"],[7232,"\n    font-weight"],[7241,": 70"],[7306,"0;\n   "],[7307," font"],[7430,"-size: 1"],[7433,".5rem;"],[7433,"\n   "],[7490," letter-spacing: -"],[7497,"0.02"],[7556,"em;\n "],[7556," }\n  ."],[7740,"nav-links a {"],[7750,"\n    color"],[7750,": var(--color"],[7750,"-muted, #6"],[7750,"b"],[7815,"7280"],[7822,");\n"],[7844,"    text-decoration:"],[7857," none;\n   "],[7903," font-size: "],[7914,"0.87"],[7939,"5rem;\n"],[8026,"    transition: color"],[8036," "],[8079,"0.15"],[8080,"s;\n "],[8099," }\n  ."],[8178,"nav-links a:hover"],[8310," {\n    color"],[8321,": var(--color"],[8321,"-text, #1"],[8321,"11);\n"],[8321,"  }\n"],[8381,"  .project-card"],[8441," {\n    transition"],[8452,": transform 0"],[8452,".2"],[8552,"s, box-shadow"],[8559," 0."],[8571,"2s;\n"],[8621,"  }\n "],[8654," .project-card:hover"],[8664," {\n    transform"],[8728,": translateY(-2"],[8760,"px);\n   "],[8771," box-shadow: "],[8869,"0 8px"],[8879," 2"],[8879,"4px r